an ego thing a little bit,

00:09:30.036 --> 00:09:31.370
I'm not gonna lie.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:32.605
But it was also a comfort thing.

00:09:32.605 --> 00:09:34.507
When I used to go out
to these Pride marches,

00:09:34.507 --> 00:09:37.743
and lesbian events
or LGBT events like,

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:40.780 align:start size:88% position:13%
