changed their life.

00:09:48.321 --> 00:09:49.555
I helped them come
out of the closet,

00:09:49.555 --> 00:09:51.958
I helped them be who
they, be who they are.

00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:54.894
And it's like, I'm the same
person that I was back then.

00:09:54.894 --> 00:09:58.164
